<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Terms & Conditions | NetZeroMart</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/assets/netZeroStickerIcon.png" />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  </head>
  <body class="bg-slate-50 text-slate-900 antialiased font-sans flex flex-col min-h-screen">
    <%- include('../components/header.ejs') %>

    <main class="flex-grow max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12">
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-8 sm:p-10 shadow-sm space-y-6">
        <div class="border-b border-slate-200 pb-4">
          <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-950">Terms and Conditions</h1>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">Last Updated: October 2026</p>
        </div>

        <section class="space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
          <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900">1. Overview of Services</h2>
          <p>
            NetZeroMart provides an online digital catalogue platform where approved vendors showcase sustainable innovations, materials, and eco-friendly products to consumers and industrial purchasers.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
          <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900">2. Vendor Subscriptions & Billing</h2>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
            <li><strong>Free Trial:</strong> A one-time 28-day complimentary subscription is provided to verified vendors upon initial account approval.</li>
            <li><strong>Subscription Plans:</strong> Vendors can choose between a 28-Day Standard Plan (₹49) or a Yearly Plan (₹499).</li>
            <li><strong>No Auto-Debit:</strong> Payments are processed manually via standard UPI, QR, or Debit Cards. We do not automatically debit bank accounts.</li>
            <li><strong>Listing Visibility:</strong> When a subscription period lapses without manual renewal, published products and articles will be hidden from public view until renewed.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
          <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900">3. Vendor Content & Accuracy</h2>
          <p>
            Vendors are solely responsible for ensuring the accuracy and veracity of technical specifications, certifications, and green credentials provided in their listings.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
          <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900">4. Contact Information</h2>
          <p>
            For inquiries regarding terms of service or payments, please reach out to <a href="mailto:netzeromart@gmail.com" class="text-blue-600 underline">netzeromart@gmail.com</a>.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </main>

    <%- include('../components/footer.ejs') %>
  </body>
</html>
